{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_007_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fd9e557b151c01a55c5e5f889cf6660dc3a512156dcf18b1e4db126612547672",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:066e73ea73dd1cdff94cc872bd13540a27ff36b9c2e0eafa3b5b2133b64a9cb5",
      "text": "嗯？这个是给我的……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a34715d041c56c52434093547b737cd71ee04dcb8522f97ad41d8d2a577418f9",
      "text": "突然送我礼物， 我是做了什么让你高兴的事吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:049996eb3976a8b51abbc9d7a1737f1d27bb0bc2051b8ca7a9753b4ff8796d8f",
      "text": "巧克力？……啊啊。 今天是情人节呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:149f2d322e8d04147363e24c022e1285ec0a9ad3e800ae2b33755a59f845bafd",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。 谢谢你送我这么棒的礼物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2534ed012931c7f56e50a78a588866eb55a0fed65994c11d4f69b97e572d6635",
      "text": "这份巧克力我之后会享用的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b202c8280ee330e83b1f165a6e3e61f46e47b8e342785be532697bc6343e054c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。 谢谢你的情人节巧克力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43ccd20c707e67090129292486637d7f0fc34fdc957461c986182f30b6afb22f",
      "text": "一想到这是你心里想着我 挑选出来的礼物……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78daeca46b3206546cc177a01df54338ad081091c7943e9f4302ad011ccbd5c7",
      "text": "总觉得稍微有点 舍不得吃掉呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_b:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fc64a41ead8a5c429aa2190fedd3653f588683cc3c4848a7dc71d1454c40172",
      "text": "您能这么说我很开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_b:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9bc4b28819c5884a285c0fd46ce4dc37c3dd43bbeac14dd56fe31404763cf8f",
      "text": "希望合圭先生的口味……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d490f51b3032f4a96362ce02be0a99bd6d93e42d49cccf76af5586aa370d1de7",
      "text": "呵呵，怎么反倒是你高兴起来了？ 真是个不可思议的人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:778d5c1ac2a084245f6aacd6dae8053d795ea04d6bdf449f8510320399970d86",
      "text": "这是你为我挑选的巧克力。 一定很好吃的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7ae5676c03541f064e5a29902d1d89713bea85c26d101776c0233dbaf35141f",
      "text": "虽然我平时不怎么吃巧克力， 但这份我会心怀感激地享用的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34cee43a295808280ba4bf20dfaf3d3b437d48e121f996ccd5ce615a2b6de70a",
      "text": "谢谢你送我这么棒的巧克力， ●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da1182df52d061e9ff994545731c258d5a5e1e5ff1d51dc3b460929a5fcaceb2",
      "text": "我这边，是在下个月的白色情人节 回礼就可以了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_007_22:5_01_007_22_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:324d3baeb7d1ac2ef0f01919a93c62333b858194c5c06fbc76779017e641a3bf",
      "text": "到那之前，我会准备点什么的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
